OL,3,ATrump, Putin and Xi plan historic joint
OL,4,Ameeting in China next week, White House
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump, Vladimir Putin and Xi
OL,8,FJinping are planning to meet on the
OL,9,Fsidelines of a summit in China next
OL,10,Fweek, the White House has said.
OL,12,FThe historic meeting between the
OL,13,Frespective leaders of the US, Russia
OL,14,Fand China will take place as Trump
OL,15,Fattends the Asia-Pacific Economic
OL,16,FCo-operation (Apec) summit in the
OL,17,Fsouthern city of Shenzhen, spokeswoman
OL,18,FOlivia Wales told reporters.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
